\n结果发现现在在日本留学生的地陪价格，\n居然要的比我都高...\n瞬间感觉，自己不行了...😂😂 https://t.co/Cd3FrAnxrQ","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1804492310492647551"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-06-22T01:14:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1804322081217352045"],"id":"1804322081217352045","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":29,"impression_count":172017,"like_count":204,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我发现日本人局都不喜欢这种骨瘦如柴型的，他们都说感觉像吸了啥的一样... https://t.co/3LgnPw4dgk","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1804322081217352045"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-06-21T03:46:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1803997953696371011"],"id":"1803997953696371011","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":90195,"like_count":24,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1803907675727761523","type":"quoted"}],"text":"大阪住着是挺快活的，市区紧凑，一个北一个南，想买啥想玩啥想吃啥走着走都能到。加上新建的项目很多，5年之后会是一个更有意思的城市。 https://t.co/WOYYtlL0VN","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1803997953696371011"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-06-20T03:24:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1803629916044558421"],"id":"1803629916044558421","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":31,"impression_count":127902,"like_count":196,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":7},"text":"大哥说砸几十万人民币睡网红，不是因为网红有多好看，活有多好。\n而是很享受那种把几百万关注她的屌丝踩在脚底的感觉...😂\n难怪最近这么多买卖抖音账号的，有种当年买文凭的感觉...\n新时代的自我价值提升手段...","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1803629916044558421"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-06-18T14:45:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1803076616207360025"],"id":"1803076616207360025","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":87,"impression_count":403779,"like_count":399,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":8},"text":"嗯，之前发那些女优合影发的，现在橘玛丽都不让合影了😂😂 https://t.co/GHy5Ui6yuV","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1803076616207360025"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-06-18T05:39:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1802939252147421211"],"id":"1802939252147421211","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":57,"impression_count":164447,"like_count":170,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":10},"text":"好多国内妹子想来日本混大哥局不知道大阪和东京该怎么选。\n\n作为东京大阪的大哥局全部都安排过的人来说，东京大哥偏体验派，就是给你各种体验，什么豪车，高级酒店，就给你各种安排体验。但就是不给你钱，就是不给你买东西。 https://t.co/5tVQEqE9Uz","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1802939252147421211"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-06-17T02:42:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1802532208705773674"],"id":"1802532208705773674","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":38,"impression_count":108707,"like_count":83,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":2},"text":"你们想要的那些关于メンズエステ的东西，我整理了一下发到圈子里了。\n基本这些店铺就够你们玩的了。\n我肯定还有自己保留店铺，\n都告诉你们了，我该没得玩了😉 https://t.co/mPERJ9j70G","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1802532208705773674"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-06-15T05:32:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1801849918883258454","1801850130121036242"],"id":"1801850130121036242","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":93349,"like_count":126,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":4},"text":"跟海外的海外的华人圈做生意，\n一定需要查这个人在同行业里的口碑，\n只要同行业里骂这个人骂的越狠，\n说明这个人在这个行业里做的越好🙃\n因为中国人做生意只会夸对自己没有竞争力的人","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1801850130121036242"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-06-15T05:31:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1801849918883258454","1801850130121036242"],"id":"1801849918883258454","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":478,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"跟海外的海外的华人圈做生意，\n一定需要查这个人在同行业里的口碑，\n只要同行业里骂这个人骂的越狠，\n说明这个人在这个行业里做的越好🙃","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1801849918883258454"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-06-14T16:29:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1801653249155772878"],"id":"1801653249155772878","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":120478,"like_count":84,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":5},"text":"大阪这边的会所让他们做的好low啊...\n但里面的妹子真的一个比一个天菜，\n每天晚上流水也是几千万上亿日元的级别，\n给妹子