不会来的，我来帮你招。 https://t.co/9vJR4JDxaR","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1800014192180916336"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-06-10T02:32:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1799992912656420984"],"id":"1799992912656420984","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":32,"impression_count":103809,"like_count":79,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":4},"text":"又下来一个五年高度人才，拿我们公司办五年高度人才签证真的是百分百下啊...\n圈子里有专门负责办高度人才签证的客服 ，想润的直接加客服办就行。😌 https://t.co/QIEok5DtAz","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1799992912656420984"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-06-09T14:38:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1799813427604631862"],"id":"1799813427604631862","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":118326,"like_count":78,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":2},"text":"嗯，吉原等各种泡泡浴地区管事的... https://t.co/Fvm4MXwtY1","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1799813427604631862"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"51115421","created_at":"2024-06-20T21:47:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1803907675727761523"],"id":"1803907675727761523","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":44,"impression_count":176360,"like_count":739,"quote_count":45,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":209},"text":"『世界で最も幸福な都市2024年版（HAPPY CITY INDEX 2024）』で大阪が日本国内唯一の『金の都市』に選ばれました！東京・札幌・神戸は『銀の都市』を獲得。\nhttps://t.co/jkjeHPGHTr https://t.co/8Lv7KFFlTo"}],"users":[{"id":"222316578","name":"梁","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1772826334999502848/ZdX2uBog_normal.jpg","username":"iam678","verified":false},{"id":"51115421","name":"ロング＠再都市化","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1249734001864007680/060VzRR3_normal.jpg","username":"saitoshika_west","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"1806600561485283810","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3fr62fo33djffbhjabzbvl4m7qf8nst","oldest_id":"1799813427604631862","result_count":25}}